alf, placeholder text 'Your email address' in Foil Silver (#8FA8C0) Archivo 400 15px, 20px left padding. The submit button 'Subscribe Free': attached directly to the right end of the input (no gap), Void Pixel (#1A1040) background, Glosspop White (#F0F4FF) label text, Nunito 700, 14px, all-caps, border-radius 999px on the right half, 24px horizontal padding, 14px vertical padding. The combined pill has a 3px Void Pixel (#1A1040) outer border and a subtle top-highlight gloss overlay (white to transparent, 30% opacity, top half only) \u2014 the glossy pill treatment from the Y2K visual cues applied to the form itself.\n\nDISCLAIMER MICRO-TEXT: 'Free forever. Unsubscribe anytime.' \u2014 Montserrat uppercase, 9px, 0.12em tracking, Void Pixel (#1A1040) at 50% opacity, centered, 12px margin-top from the input row.\n\nRESPONSIVE: On mobile, the input and button stack vertically (input full-width, button full-width below it, both with border-radius 999px independently). Headline scales to 32px. Glossy pill ornaments scale down to 120px wide and remain in corners."
